data: {"type":"response.output_item.done","item":{"type":"web_search_call","id":"srvtoolu_ds_00_6aefe1bb08ee4009a903826d426bbd07","status":"completed","kind":"deep_search","action":{"type":"search","queries":["latest stable Rust version release date 2025","Rust blog announce Rust 1.90 stable release"],"sources":[{"type":"url","url":"https://blog.rust-lang.org/releases/","title":"The Rust Release Announcements","snippet":"Releases in 2025 Dec. 11 | Announcing Rust 1.92.0 Nov. 10 | Announcing Rust 1.91.1 Oct. 30 | Announcing Rust 1.91.0","site_name":"Rust Language Blog","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust-lang.org"},{"type":"url","url":"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2025/10/30/Rust-1.91.0/?via=dailydev#contributors-to-1-91-0","title":"Announcing Rust 1.91.0 | Rust Blog","snippet":"Announcing Rust 1.91.0 Oct. 30, 2025 · The Rust Release Team The Rust team is happy to announce a new version of Rust, 1.91.0.","site_name":"Rust Language Blog","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust-lang.org","published_at":"2025-10-29T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2025/05/15/Rust-1.87.0/?source=-----01746ef589ae---------------------------------------#asm-jumps-to-rust-code","title":"Announcing Rust 1.87.0 and ten years of Rust! | Rust Blog","snippet":"1.87.0 and ten years of Rust! May 15, 2025 · The Rust Release Team Live from the 10 Years of Rust celebration in Utrecht, Netherlands, the Rust team is happy to announce a new version of Rust...","site_name":"Rust Language Blog","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust-lang.org","published_at":"2025-05-14T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://rust.googlesource.com/rust-lang/rust/+/e0cb4ced0a42d137b2f85f06dd45667299863fa2/CHANGELOG.md","title":"Changelog","snippet":"Unreleased / Beta / In Rust Nightly ## Rust 1.87 Current stable, released 2025-05-15 ... Rust 1.86 Current stable, released 2025-04-03","site_name":"googlesource.com","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/googlesource.com"},{"type":"url","url":"https://bugs.launchpad.net/ubuntu/+bug/2120340/+activity#1","title":"Activity log for bug #2120340 - Activity log for bug #2120340","snippet":"1.88 was released on 26 June, 2025. ... As of 11 August 2025, the current stable version of Rust is 1.89.0, meaning that we’re getting closer but still have some work to do.","site_name":"Launchpad Bugs","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/launchpad.net"},{"type":"url","url":"https://lwn.net/Articles/1049996/bigpage#6","title":"LWN.net Weekly Edition for December 18, 2025 - Rust 1.92.0 released","snippet":"Rust 1.92.0 released Version 1.92.0 of the Rust language has been released. This release includes a number of stabilized APIs, emits unwind tables by default on Linux, validates input to #[macro_export], and much more.","site_name":"LWN.net","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/lwn.net","published_at":"2025-12-17T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"http://man.openbsd.org/cgi-bin/cvsweb/ports/lang/rust/Makefile?r1=1.7","title":"CVS log for ports/lang/rust/Makefile","snippet":"lang/rust: update to 1.90.0 Announce: https://blog.rust-lang.org/2025/09/18/Rust-1.90.0/ Release notes: https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/releases.html#version-1900-2025-09-18","site_name":"OpenBSD manual pages","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/openbsd.org"},{"type":"url","url":"https://rust.dev/news/rust-1-92-0-released","title":"Rust 1.92.0 released","snippet":"Rust 1.92.0 released Latest stable Rust release (Dec 11, 2025). Great time to re-index new features and update learning materials. ... Rust 1.92.0 is a stable toolchain release.","site_name":"rust.dev","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust.dev","published_at":"2025-12-10T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://rust.googlesource.com/cargo/+/1566e4c346b1dd511492e760e9c02a12d6b1f61c","title":"Cargo","snippet":"[`v1.85`](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/RELEASES.md#Version-1850-2025-02-20) ... - [The 2024 Edition is now stable.](https://redirect.github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/133349)","site_name":"googlesource.com","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/googlesource.com"},{"type":"url","url":"https://safeguard.sh/resources/blog/rust-release-history-from-1-0-to-the-2024-edition-six-week-trains-editions-governance-and-security-response#the-rfc-process-and-the-teams","title":"Rust Release History: 1.0 to the 2024 Edition, Trains and Security","snippet":"the last one stabilized in Rust 1.85.0 on 20 February 2025) ... The current stable at the time of writing is Rust 1.99.1, released on 15 October 2026.","site_name":"Blog | Safeguard — Software Supply Chain Security Insights","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/safeguard.sh","published_at":"2026-10-24T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2025/09/18/Rust-1.90.0/","title":"Announcing Rust 1.90.0 | Rust Blog","snippet":"Announcing Rust 1.90.0 Sept. 18, 2025 · The Rust Release Team The Rust team is happy to announce a new version of Rust, 1.90.0. ... If you have a previous version of Rust installed viarustup...","site_name":"Rust Language Blog","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust-lang.org","published_at":"2025-09-17T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://social.rust-lang.org/@rust/115226918528405945","title":"Rust Language (@rust@social.rust-lang.org)","snippet":"Rust 1.90.0 has been released ... linux-gnu and adds `cargo publish --workspace` to publish an entire workspace all at once! Check out the blog post and release notes for more: https://blog.rust-lang.org/2025/09/18/Rust-1.90.0/","site_name":"rust-lang.org","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust-lang.org","published_at":"2025-09-17T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://blog.rust-lang.org/tags/release/","title":"Posts tagged \"release\" | Rust Blog","snippet":"Posts in 2025 Dec. 11 | Announcing Rust 1.92.0 Nov. 10 | Announcing Rust 1.91.1 Oct. 30 | Announcing Rust 1.91.0 Sept. 18 | Announcing Rust 1.90.0 Aug. 7 | Announcing Rust 1.89.0","site_name":"Rust Language Blog","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/rust-lang.org"},{"type":"url","url":"https://www.phoronix.com/news/Rust-1.90-Released","title":"Rust 1.90 Released With LLD Default On Linux x86_64 While macOS x86_64 Demoted","snippet":"Rust 1.90 Released With LLD Default On Linux x86_64 While macOS x86_64 Demoted ... Rust 1.90 is out today as the newest feature release for this popular programming language.","site_name":"Phoronix","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/phoronix.com","published_at":"2025-09-17T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://cloud.tencent.cn/developer/article/2603480?policyId=1003#1","title":"Rust 1.90.0 发布：新特性、编译器改进与兼容性更新详解 - 福大大架构师每日一题","snippet":"Rust 语言团队于 2025 年 9 月 19 日 发布了 Rust 1.90.0 稳定版本。本次更新在语言特性、编译器、平台支持、标准库、Cargo、Rustdoc 以及兼容性方面带来了重要变化。","site_name":"tencent.cn","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/tencent.cn","published_at":"2025-12-17T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://bbs.huaweicloud.com/blogs/461906#1","title":"Rust 1.90.0 发布：新特性、编译器改进与兼容性更新详解 - 冒泡提示","snippet":"【摘要】 Rust 语言团队于 2025 年 9 月 19 日 发布了 Rust 1.90.0 稳定版本。本次更新在语言特性、编译器、平台支持、标准库、Cargo、Rustdoc 以及兼容性方面带来了重要变化。本文将为你详细解读这些更新。 语言（Language）将 unknown_or_malformed_diagnostic_attributes lint 拆分。该 lint 已拆分为四个更细化的...","site_name":"华为云社区","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/huaweicloud.com","published_at":"2025-09-19T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://gihyo.jp/article/2025/09/rust-1.90","title":"Rust 1.90リリース、LinuxのデフォルトリンカとしてLLDを採用 | gihyo.jp","snippet":"Rust 1.90リリース、LinuxのデフォルトリンカとしてLLDを採用 ... Rustリリースチームは2025年9月18日、Rustの新バージョン1. ... LLDへの移行の経緯や検討内容については以下のRustブログを参照。","site_name":"gihyo.jp","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/gihyo.jp","published_at":"2025-09-18T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://codezine.jp/news/detail/22295","title":"Rustの新バージョン「Rust 1.90.0」がリリース","snippet":"プログラミング言語Rustの開発チームは、9月18日、最新バージョンとなる「Rust 1.90.0」をリリースした。  今回のバージョンでは、x86_64-unknown-linux-gnuターゲットでデフォルトリンカがLLDへ変更された。特に大規模なバイナリや、デバッグ情報が多いバイナリなどで、リンキングパフォーマンスが向上する見込み。  また、cargo publish --workspace","site_name":"CodeZine","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/codezine.jp","published_at":"2025-09-25T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://thinkit.co.jp/index%2ephp/news/38550","title":"プログラミング言語「Rust 1.90」リリース","snippet":"[運営] 株式会社インプレス  Mozillaは9月18日（現地時間）、プログラミング言語Rustの最新版、「Rust 1.90」をリリースした。  「Rust」は、並列計算・関数型かつマルチパラダイムのプログラミング言語。C/C++ライクな文法を持つ。純関数型、並列計算モデル、手続き型、オブジェクト指向をサポートしており、安全性、速度、並列性にフォーカスしている。  「Rust 1.90」では、","site_name":"Think IT（シンクイット）","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/thinkit.co.jp","published_at":"2025-09-27T16:00:00+00:00"},{"type":"url","url":"https://gihyo.jp/article/2025/09/rust-1.90?summary","title":"Rust 1.90リリース、LinuxのデフォルトリンカとしてLLDを採用 | gihyo.jp","snippet":"gihyo.jp サイトのロゴ メニュー 検索 カテゴリー OS・デスクトップ フロントエンド開発 バックエンド開発 プログラミング一般 機械学習・AI デバイス・IoT 科学・数学 デザイン・イラスト ビジネススキル 趣味・ネットサービス サイトについて このサイトについて プライバシーポリシー 広告掲載のご案内 お問い合わせ メールマガジン RSSフィード SNS Rust 1. 90リリース","site_name":"gihyo.jp","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/gihyo.jp","published_at":"2025-09-18T16:00:00+00:00"}]}},"output_index":1,"sequence_number":40}

